    "result_text": "All 12 tests pass. The change is complete.\n\n## Summary\n\nThe `initials` field is a computed, read-only property on the `Owner` response, so I mirrored the existing `displayName` pattern:\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 Added an `initials` property to the `Owner` schema (read-only string), which drives generation of the `OwnerDto` field.\n\n2. **`src/main/java/.../mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 Added a MapStruct `@Mapping` expression on `toOwnerDto`:\n   ```java\n   @Mapping(target = \"initials\",\n       expression = \"java(Character.toUpperCase(owner.getFirstName().charAt(0)) + \\\".\\\" + Character.toUpperCase(owner.getLastName().charAt(0)) + \\\".\\\")\")\n   ```\n   This produces the upper-cased first letters of `firstName` and `lastName`, dot-separated with a trailing dot (e.g. `john smith` \u2192 `J.S.`).\n\nThe new `Cp06Tests` and all 11 existing acceptance tests pass (`BUILD SUCCESS`, 12 tests, 0 failures).",
